  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Checkered Balloon.png|200px|left|Checkered Balloon]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 45\n |musicalnote = 30\n |time = 45m\n |source = {{Infoicon|bballoonmaker|bigger|link=Birthday Balloon Maker}}\n |xp = 166\n |dia = 15\n}}\n'''Checkered Balloon''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 45. It's a special item used only for the Aniversary 2024 event.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Checkered Balloon'''===\n[[File:Birthday Balloon Maker.png|150px|left|Birthday Balloon Maker]]\nCheckered balloons are made in the [[Birthday Balloon Maker]].\n\nTo make an checkered balloon, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Honey.png|75px|Honey|link=Honey]]\n|[[File:Caffè Mocha.png|75px|Caffè Mocha|link=Caffè Mocha]]\n|[[File:Corn.png|75px|Corn|link=Corn]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\nIt takes 45 minutes to make an balloon. Each balloon gives players 166 [[experience]] points.\n\nIn 2025, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Soothing Pad.png|75px|Soothing Path|link=Soothing Pad]]\n|[[File:Coffee Bean.png|75px|Coffee Bean|link=Coffee Bean]]\n|[[File:Strawberry.png|75px|Strawberry|link=Strawberry]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 10 minutes to make an balloon. Each balloon gives players ?? [[experience]] points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 balloon per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each balloon used on a boat will be rewarded with 30 [[Musical Note]]s, 33 musical note in a 1-star and mastered maker, 42 musical note in a 2-star and 60 musical note in a 3-star.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n[[Category:Birthday Balloon Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Honey Products]]\n[[Category:Caffè Mocha Products]]\n[[Category:Corn Products]]\n\n{{Languages\n|de = Karierter Ballon \n|es = Globo a cuadros\n}}",
